==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ěsti}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*ēˀstei}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁édti}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ru|ѣсть||ru-PRO}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-есть.ogg}}
* {{a|ru|proscribed, only the infinitive and its derivations}} {{IPAchar|[jisʲtʲ]}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|есть|impf|pf=съесть,пое́сть}}

# to [[eat]]
#: {{uxi|ru|Он '''ел''' мя́со и сала́т.|He '''was eating''' meat and salad.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[есть поедо́м]]|to [[make]] someone's [[life]] a [[misery]] by [[nagging]]}}
#* {{RQ:RSB|Mark|2|26|Как вошёл он в дом Бо́жий при первосвяще́ннике Авиафа́ре и ел хле́бы предложе́ния, кото́рых не должно́ бы́ло '''есть''' никому́, кро́ме свяще́нников, и дал и бы́вшим с ним?|t=How did he enter the house of God in the presence of the High Priest Abiathar and eat the bread of offering, which should not '''be eaten''' by no one other than the High Priest, and give it to those that were with him?}}

